They are based on "The Mochi Housing and Inner Frame" by Dave0616,
https://makerworld.com/en/models/1844353-the-mochi-housing-and-inner-frame-dasai-mochi
which is CC BY-NC-SA. The inner frame, OLED holder and back plate are his design,
the outer Clawd and Mac bodies and the stands are by Deepak Popli.

Clawd is Anthropic's mascot. This is a fan project, not affiliated with Anthropic.
